<li><p class='igt' id='i40'><span class='words' id='i40w'><span class="word" id="i40w0">Dingit'a</span><span class="word" id="i40w1">yitiɬdhidi</span><span class="word" id="i40w2">ts'i'a.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i40g'><span class="gloss" id="i40g0">should</span><span class="gloss" id="i40g1">she leaves him alone</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i40ft'>'She ought to just leave him alone.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i41'><span class='words' id='i41w'><span class="word" id="i41w0">Che</span><span class="word" id="i41w1">yughu dhidonh</span><span class="word" id="i41w2">deɬ'anh</span><span class="word" id="i41w3">ts'i'a</span><span class="word" id="i41w4">getiy</span><span class="word" id="i41w5">xoghyele,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i41w6">xaɬne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i41g'><span class="gloss" id="i41g0">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i41g1">her spouse</span><span class="gloss" id="i41g2">she does</span><span class="gloss" id="i41g3"></span><span class="gloss" id="i41g4">very</span><span class="gloss" id="i41g5">she's jealous of him</span><span class="gloss" id="i41g6">they said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i41ft'>'She's just jealous doing that again to the one she lives with,&quot; they said.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i42'><span class='words' id='i42w'><span class="word" id="i42w0">Ts'an</span><span class="word" id="i42w1">yidighenek</span><span class="word" id="i42w2">ts'i</span><span class="word" id="i42w3">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i42w4">ngiyiggi</span><span class="word" id="i42w5">traɬtth'et</span><span class="word" id="i42w6">xinagh</span><span class="word" id="i42w7">xits'idz</span><span class="word" id="i42w8">xiyentithiyo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i42g'><span class="gloss" id="i42g0">so then</span><span class="gloss" id="i42g1">she finished</span><span class="gloss" id="i42g2"></span><span class="gloss" id="i42g3">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i42g4">down there</span><span class="gloss" id="i42g5">kashim</span><span class="gloss" id="i42g6">instead</span><span class="gloss" id="i42g7">to</span><span class="gloss" id="i42g8">he went into</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i42ft'>'So then when she had finished he went to his kashim instead (of going to his house).'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i43'><span class='words' id='i43w'><span class="word" id="i43w0">Yeg yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i43w1">yina'</span><span class="word" id="i43w2">yiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i43w3">diniɬtl'ets</span><span class="word" id="i43w4">ɬogo</span><span class="word" id="i43w5">,</span><span class="word" id="i43w6">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i43w7">yina</span><span class="word" id="i43w8">yiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i43w9">iɬcheth</span><span class="word" id="i43w10">ts'in'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i43g'><span class="gloss" id="i43g0">actually</span><span class="gloss" id="i43g1">his face</span><span class="gloss" id="i43g2">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i43g3">she blackened</span><span class="gloss" id="i43g4">truly</span><span class="gloss" id="i43g5">just</span><span class="gloss" id="i43g6">his face</span><span class="gloss" id="i43g7">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i43g8">she punched</span><span class="gloss" id="i43g9"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i43ft'>'In there she gave him a black eye, punching him in the face.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i44'><span class='words' id='i44w'><span class="word" id="i44w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i44w1">yits'i</span><span class="word" id="i44w2">xiyen-giduqonh,</span><span class="word" id="i44w3">yehelts'i</span><span class="word" id="i44w4">ɬogot.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i44g'><span class="gloss" id="i44g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i44g1">to him</span><span class="gloss" id="i44g2">food was brought in</span><span class="gloss" id="i44g3">he didn't eat it</span><span class="gloss" id="i44g4">truly</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i44ft'>'And then when she brought food in to him he didn't eat.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i45'><span class='words' id='i45w'><span class="word" id="i45w0">Yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i45w1">getiy</span><span class="word" id="i45w2">viyenxighedhit.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i45g'><span class="gloss" id="i45g0">just</span><span class="gloss" id="i45g1">very</span><span class="gloss" id="i45g2">he was angry</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i45ft'>'He was very, very angry.'</span></p></li>
<p class="english">(In the middle of the next sentence, someone says &quot;yeah?&quot;.)</p>
<p class="english">BD:</p>
<li><p class='igt' id='i46'><span class='words' id='i46w'><span class="word" id="i46w0">&quot;Q'ode</span><span class="word" id="i46w1">axaxiɬdik,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i46w2">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i46w3">denedhinh</span><span class="word" id="i46w4">ɬogot</span><span class="word" id="i46w5">.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i46g'><span class="gloss" id="i46g0">now</span><span class="gloss" id="i46g1">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i46g2">just</span><span class="gloss" id="i46g3">he thought thus</span><span class="gloss" id="i46g4">truly</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i46ft'>&quot;'That was that,&quot; he thought to himself.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i47'><span class='words' id='i47w'><span class="word" id="i47w0">&quot;Diyogh</span><span class="word" id="i47w1">gidegh</span><span class="word" id="i47w2">tidhisqayts'i</span><span class="word" id="i47w3">go</span><span class="word" id="i47w4">engan'---</span><span class="word" id="i47w5">ndagh</span><span class="word" id="i47w6">ixindagh</span><span class="word" id="i47w7">sitth'in</span><span class="word" id="i47w8">toloɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i47w9">xits'in'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i47g'><span class="gloss" id="i47g0">should</span><span class="gloss" id="i47g1">away</span><span class="gloss" id="i47g2">I paddle off</span><span class="gloss" id="i47g3">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i47g4">across</span><span class="gloss" id="i47g5">where</span><span class="gloss" id="i47g6">somewhere</span><span class="gloss" id="i47g7">my bone</span><span class="gloss" id="i47g8">where they will be</span><span class="gloss" id="i47g9">to</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i47ft'>&quot;'I should paddle away somewhere far across the water to where my bones will lie.'<a href="#n3" class="notelink">3</a>,<a href="#n4" class="notelink">4</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i48'><span class='words' id='i48w'><span class="word" id="i48w0">Dingit'a</span><span class="word" id="i48w1">tidhisqay</span><span class="word" id="i48w2">getiy</span><span class="word" id="i48w3">vitr'iginoghginiy</span><span class="word" id="i48w4">(go)danh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i48g'><span class="gloss" id="i48g0">should</span><span class="gloss" id="i48g1">let me paddle</span><span class="gloss" id="i48g2">very</span><span class="gloss" id="i48g3">I hate her</span><span class="gloss" id="i48g4">this person</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i48ft'>'It's better that I should paddle away for I'm really tired of her.'</span></p></li>
