<li><p class='igt' id='i234'><span class='words' id='i234w'><span class="word" id="i234w0">Xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i234w1">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i234w2">niɬtoyitlch'iɬ</span><span class="word" id="i234w3">ts'i</span><span class="word" id="i234w4">yuxudz.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i234g'><span class="gloss" id="i234g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i234g1">just</span><span class="gloss" id="i234g2">she tore her apart</span><span class="gloss" id="i234g3"></span><span class="gloss" id="i234g4">just</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i234ft'>'For she had torn her entirely apart.'</span></p></li>
