<li><p class='igt' id='i277'><span class='words' id='i277w'><span class="word" id="i277w0">Angithegh</span><span class="word" id="i277w1">xantthaghluquyhdi,</span><span class="word" id="i277w2">&quot;choyalim'</span><span class="word" id="i277w3">choyalim',&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i277w4">ditadhine'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i277g'><span class="gloss" id="i277g0">out on water</span><span class="gloss" id="i277g1">she came to surface</span><span class="gloss" id="i277g2">grandchild</span><span class="gloss" id="i277g3"></span><span class="gloss" id="i277g4">she started to say</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i277ft'>'Out in the ocean she came up to the surface, &quot;grandchild, grandchild,&quot; she said.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i278'><span class='words' id='i278w'><span class="word" id="i278w0">Hingo</span><span class="word" id="i278w1">go</span><span class="word" id="i278w2">eyiggin</span><span class="word" id="i278w3">dn---</span><span class="word" id="i278w4">niɬ'oqay</span><span class="word" id="i278w5">yixi</span><span class="word" id="i278w6">xinontthixitl'uquyh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i278g'><span class="gloss" id="i278g0">meanwhile</span><span class="gloss" id="i278g1">this</span><span class="gloss" id="i278g2">that</span><span class="gloss" id="i278g3"></span><span class="gloss" id="i278g4">married couple</span><span class="gloss" id="i278g5">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i278g6">they came back to the surface</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i278ft'>'At the same time that man and his wife came to the surface.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i279'><span class='words' id='i279w'><span class="word" id="i279w0">Giɬigginh</span><span class="word" id="i279w1">xizrolche</span><span class="word" id="i279w2">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i279w3">anh</span><span class="word" id="i279w4">gu'ot</span><span class="word" id="i279w5">xizrolche</span><span class="word" id="i279w6">anh,</span><span class="word" id="i279w7"><em>big white bear</span><span class="word" id="i279w8">polar bear</span><span class="word" id="i279w9">.</em></span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i279g'><span class="gloss" id="i279g0">one person</span><span class="gloss" id="i279g1">apparently</span><span class="gloss" id="i279g2">just</span><span class="gloss" id="i279g3">that person</span><span class="gloss" id="i279g4">wife</span><span class="gloss" id="i279g5">apparently</span><span class="gloss" id="i279g6">that person</span><span class="gloss" id="i279g7">taxghozr</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i279ft'>'One of them, the wife, suddenly had become a big white bear, a polar bear.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i280'><span class='words' id='i280w'><span class="word" id="i280w0">Viqing'</span><span class="word" id="i280w1">che</span><span class="word" id="i280w2"><em>polar bear</span><span class="word" id="i280w3">ngilanh</span><span class="word" id="i280w4">ts'i</span><span class="word" id="i280w5">xantthixiluquyh.</em></span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i280g'><span class="gloss" id="i280g0">her husband</span><span class="gloss" id="i280g1">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i280g2">taxghozr</span><span class="gloss" id="i280g3">he is</span><span class="gloss" id="i280g4"></span><span class="gloss" id="i280g5">he surfaced</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i280ft'>'Her husband also surfaced as a polar bear.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i281'><span class='words' id='i281w'><span class="word" id="i281w0">Agide</span><span class="word" id="i281w1">xits'i,</span><span class="word" id="i281w2">idixinlu'on'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i281g'><span class="gloss" id="i281g0">enough</span><span class="gloss" id="i281g1">to it</span><span class="gloss" id="i281g2">the end</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i281ft'>'All right then it is finished.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i282'><span class='words' id='i282w'><span class="word" id="i282w0">Yuk.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i282g'><span class="gloss" id="i282g0">(listener's response at end of story)</span><span class="gloss" id="i282g1"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i282ft'></span></p></li>
</ol></div><div id='notes'><h2>Notes</h2><ol><li><span class="footnote" id="n1"><em> Dikul xixi'nen </em> can also mean 'they're friends with them' (ED).</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n2">Since the protagonist is on the water, ngitthegh 'downhill (to water)' is puzzling here, unless Belle is perhaps telling the story from the perspective of the people on the land.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n3">'for one's bones to lie'; i.e. to spend the rest of one's life there and be buried there</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n4">'across' is normally <em> engan.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n5">on a river there</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n6">edidi seems to be a reduced customary form of 'sg. sits, lives'. <em> idoyhdi </em> would be expected.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n7">This is Jeff Leer's suggested analysis of chel a che.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n8">Usually yitongo</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n9"><em> dichidhi--- </em> could be completed in different ways: <em> dichidhighiɬ </em> 'boat went into slough', <em> dichidhiqanh </em> 'he/she paddled into slough', for example.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n10">The first wife is referred to from here with <em> tr'i-/zr-.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n11">In her English version of the story, Belle says at this point, &quot;I'm finish. I got ready for your wife.&quot;</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n12">This is the free translation from the print version. Belle's English version lacks this section.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n13"><em> kula </em> also said when taking pity on someone or something, 'poor thing'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n14">Is Belle referring to Karen McPherson's hair?</span></li></ol>
</div>
</div>
